# Assembly: one's DAOs; in each DAO its proposals; a screen for each proposal to vote and decide on.
screen Home
  inbox
  me: identity, person
  list DAOs: atoms of member; opens Dao
  list People: everyone; shows knows, listed; opens Person
  Establish
  Acquaint: Bob = field
  Found: Delos = field

screen Dao(d)
  inbox
  d.1: steward, listed
  list Proposals: atoms of proposal with d.1; shows passed, rejected; opens Proposal
  Propose: Delos = d.1, Alice = d.2, Prop = field
  Propose own: Delos = d.1, Prop = field

screen Proposal(q)
  inbox
  q: proposed, vote_for, vote_against, voted, decided, passed, rejected, delivered, delivered_vote, delivered_decision
  Vote for: Prop = q.1, Delos = q.2, Alice = pick of member
  Vote against: Prop = q.1, Delos = q.2, Alice = pick of member
  Vote own for: Prop = q.1, Delos = q.2
  Vote own against: Prop = q.1, Delos = q.2
  Pass: Prop = q.1, Delos = q.2
  Reject: Prop = q.1, Delos = q.2

screen Person(p)
  inbox
  p: knows, listed
  Introduce: Bob = p, Carol = pick of knows
  Introduce: Carol = p, Bob = pick of knows
  Join: Bob = p, Delos = pick of steward
